# Trust: Ingrid (hidden quest TrustIngrid): a level 99 Warrior in Eastern Adoulin. Rigobertine (no script, no default).
# SoA The Merciless One completed (setup). No permit: nothing. The Windurst Trust Permit (a GM): 5062; finished on 0:
# nothing; again, finished on 2: Ingrid learned, YOU_LEARNED_TRUST. Learned: nothing.
lists EasternAdoulin/Rigobertine/onTrigger EasternAdoulin/onEventFinish/5062
char zone=EasternAdoulin pos=68,-40.15,12.2 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Soa TheMercilessOne completed
login
trigger Rigobertine                     # no permit: nothing
keyitem WindurstTrustPermit             # a GM
trigger Rigobertine                     # 5062
finish option=0                         # not 2: nothing
trigger Rigobertine                     # 5062
finish option=2                         # Ingrid learned, YOU_LEARNED_TRUST
trigger Rigobertine                     # learned: nothing
